 2. 🎤 Macklemore announces &quot;Free Palestine&quot; tour 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Screenshot: @macklemore /X Rapper Macklemore announced a "Free Palestine" tour today, with stops in Dublin, Paris and London.

 That's after he was dropped from Ed Sheeran's "Loop Tour" after making pro-Palestinian comments during a performance. 🤳 Macklemore wrote on X: "What happened to me is bigger than one artist or one stage. When the billionaire class can decide which voices are allowed on stage and which ones are too dangerous to hear, everyone should be paying attention."

 "So we're going on tour. All proceeds will benefit organizations supporting the Palestinian people and movement." What's next: Artists and U.S. dates are TBD, the rapper said on Instagram .

