 What is the true scale of global AI investment? 
 &nbsp; 
 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Estimates of AI expenditure often overlook private and foreign investments.


 Goldman Sachs economists factor this spend into their adjusted measure of AI investment, which they estimate will reach $1 trillion globally by the end of the year.


