 3. ⚡️ Catch me up 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Image: CNN via @BrianStelter /X 🚫 Reporters for MS NOW, CNN and Politico were back on White House grounds this afternoon after a federal judge ordered the Trump administration to reinstate their access. The ruling didn't address the rotating TV pool. Get the latest . 🛰️ Google and SpaceX are set to launch an experimental satellite to test the idea of AI data centers in space, the N.Y. Times reports. Gift link . 🐼 China is sending two pandas to Zoo Atlanta after Beijing reclaimed four of them in 2024 amid diplomatic tensions, Chinese President Xi Jinping announced during his state visit today. Go deeper . 
 
